! Switches re-added for the derived meshed case (see README_meshed.md).
! These were left commented-out in the per-feeder LV*/Switches.dss files when the
! combined model was made radial. Restored here, deduplicated by name (the 34
! _OPEN inter-feeder ties were each cross-listed in both feeders they bridge).
!   - 34 *_OPEN   : normally-open ties; opened by `open` commands in Master_meshed.dss
!   - 4  *_CLOSED : intra-feeder loop switches that make the network non-radial
